        <!-- Services Section with Stacked Swiper Cards -->
        <section id="services" class="services">
          <div class="wrapper">
            <div class="services-container">
              <h2><strong>Our Pediatric Dental Spectrum for Kids &amp; Teens</strong></h2>
              <p>Children are not miniature adults; they see the world through different eyes – and that naturally applies to dental treatments too. Our team of experienced pediatric dentists, dental nurses, and prophylaxis specialists is devoted to giving every child and teenager the highest quality care.</p>
              <p>With boundless patience and gentle empathy, we explain each step playfully, provide thoughtful advice to accompanying parents, and take all the time needed to adapt to each young personality. Together in our friendly, colorful atmosphere, we work to give little ones the best gift from their very first milk tooth: a cheerful experience, a healthy routine, and a shining, confident smile!</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Swiper Container -->
            <div class="swiper">
              <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>Early Start!</h3>
                  <p>We recommend your child's first visit as soon as the first tooth emerges. Alongside getting to know each other and establishing trust with our doctors, early appointments focus on spotting initial risk factors, advising parents on nutrition and brushing, and nurturing playful hygiene habits before any dental anxiety ever begins.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>Children's Prophylaxis</h3>
                  <p>Health insurance often covers professional tooth cleanings twice a year for kids starting at age 6! Together with young patients, we practice fun brushing techniques and explore oral hygiene. Starting professional preventive care early establishes a confident, lasting home dental routine.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>Caries Care &amp; Fillings</h3>
                  <p>Gentle and pain-free – that is how we treat cavities in children and teenagers. We use state-of-the-art materials like tooth-colored composite and ceramic restorations alongside customized therapy concepts tailored to your child's comfort.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>Milk Tooth Crowns</h3>
                  <p>When baby teeth are severely affected, pediatric crowns preserve them from premature loss. Primary teeth are vital placeholders for incoming adult teeth and play a crucial role in oral health. We restore affected teeth painlessly thanks to gentle local anesthetics.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>General Anesthesia</h3>
                  <p>If children experience severe dental phobia or require extensive multi-tooth restorations, we provide treatment under general anesthesia right inside our clinic. Our experienced anesthesiology team ensures total comfort and safety in a calm, stress-free setting.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="swiper-slide">
                  <h3>Dental Emergencies &amp; Trauma</h3>
                  <p>Kids explore, jump, and race – and accidents can happen quickly, often affecting front incisors. Statistically, one in three children experiences a dental accident before age 16. Fast, expert trauma care is crucial for healing, so we provide immediate emergency appointments.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="swiper-button-prev" aria-label="Previous service"></div>
              <div class="swiper-button-next" aria-label="Next service"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

