                    <h2><strong>From the very first baby teeth:&nbsp;our practice for toddlers.</strong></h2>
                    <p>Examinations and playful check-ups begin right when your child gets their first milk tooth. Alongside nutritional guidance that we happily provide to parents and toddlers, we explain in child-friendly ways which foods strengthen dental health and which can harm enamel. We discuss wholesome alternatives, practice cheerful morning and evening brushing routines, and design a prevention program tailored to your child.</p>
                    <p>Together, we dissolve any fear of dental visits before it can even form. From earliest childhood, we lay the foundations of trust and positivity for every trip to our clinic. In addition to nutrition advice and interactive brushing techniques, we also offer gentle pacifier and bottle counseling.</p>
